; PLACEHOLDER GEOMETRY: a box, generated, so it carries no licence. Sized like the
; small eight-port 10/100 hubs every LAN party had -- 160 x 30 x 95 mm -- with all
; eight RJ45 sockets along one long face (local +Z), 17.5 mm apart.

