; The eight sockets. Unturned: a socket's +Z is the direction a plug arrives from,
; and on this face that is the box's own +Z. At z = 0.049, 1.5 mm out from the
; 47.5 mm face, so the recess's mouth stands proud of the shell instead of
; fighting it for the same plane.
